sgp 2

given
  k1 = circle(O)

construct
  point A on k1
  point B on k1
  point C on k1
  point D on k1
  polygon ABCD
    d1: |AB| = 2
    d2: |BC| = 3
    d3: |CD| = 4
    d4: |DA| = 5

find
